,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_29","text":"I had a hard time believing they'd hire someone so foolish.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_30","text":"Hmm... Being an operator is tough.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_31","text":"I managed to initiate the purification sequence, but I was in over my head with everything else.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_32","text":"You've done your homework. Not even Exia suspected you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_33","text":"Why, thank you! While I was in the hospital recovering from those smashed ribs you gave me,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_34","text":"I had plenty of time to hatch up ways to exact my revenge.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_35","text":"In the end, I decided a deep fake was the way to go.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_36","text":"It was almost a month of hard work, but it was worth it to hoodwink all of you!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_37","text":"How was it? Didn't I seem like the real Shifty?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_38","text":"I think I'm a pretty good actor too, don't you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_39","text":"What happened to Shifty?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_40","text":"She's off participating in routine training camp or something like that. She's been there for the past month.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_41","text":"So it's been you from the very start.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_42","text":"Well said.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_43","text":"Was it you who sold out Exia?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_44","text":"Precisely. Who does she think she is, trying to hack the Central Government?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_45","text":"Also, it was only a matter of time until she noticed me. I had to get rid of her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_46","text":"Ah right, by the way...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_47","text":"Your connection was cut off right before you joined up with that hunk of junk Exia.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09_06_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09_06_s_48","text":"What did you guys talk about?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":nu